-	/* Evariops 0023 (SPEC-75G F-d): degraded-service observability — how
-	 * long/how much this raid has been SERVING in degraded mode, the
-	 * control plane's "EcRebuildDebt.since" gauge. Written on raid5f I/O
-	 * paths with relaxed atomics (single reactor today — D5 —, still safe
